<view class="page">
  <view class="card intro"><view class="title">月度学习归档</view><view class="muted">每个月是一段独立周期：记录、复盘与附件索引都留在同一个文件夹里。</view></view>
  <view class="card weekly"><view class="backup-title">近 7 天专注看板</view><view class="weekly-total">{{weeklyStats.totalMinutes}} 分钟</view><view class="muted">横轴是日期，纵轴是当天专注时长；只统计有归属的本机专注记录。</view><view class="bar-chart"><view wx:for="{{weeklyStats.daily}}" wx:key="start" class="bar-column"><text class="bar-value">{{item.minutes}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="height: {{item.height}}%"></view></view><text class="bar-label">{{item.label}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{weeklyStats.subjects.length}}" class="subhead">按科目分配</view><view wx:for="{{weeklyStats.subjects}}" wx:key="name" class="metric-row"><view class="metric-top"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="metric-track"><view class="metric-fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}%"></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{weeklyStats.tasks.length}}" class="subhead">按具体任务分配</view><view wx:for="{{weeklyStats.tasks}}" wx:key="name" class="metric-row"><view class="metric-top"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="metric-track task-track"><view class="metric-fill task-fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}%"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="card backup"><view class="backup-title">本机数据备份</view><view class="muted">云同步恢复前，建议定期复制完整备份，保存到 Obsidian 或自己的文件里。</view><view class="backup-status {{backupStatus.needsBackup?'backup-warning':''}}">{{backupStatus.text}}</view><view class="backup-actions"><button size="mini" class="copy-summary" bindtap="copyBackup">复制完整备份</button><button size="mini" class="restore-toggle" bindtap="toggleRestore">{{showRestore ? '收起恢复' : '恢复备份'}}</button></view><block wx:if="{{showRestore}}"><textarea class="backup-input" value="{{backupText}}" placeholder="粘贴此前复制的完整备份 JSON" maxlength="-1" auto-height bindinput="setBackupText"></textarea><button size="mini" class="preview-backup" bindtap="previewRestore">预览备份内容</button><view wx:if="{{backupPreview}}" class="backup-preview">备份包含：{{backupPreview.tasks}} 项任务 · {{backupPreview.records}} 条记录 · {{backupPreview.reviews}} 条复盘 · 专注 {{backupPreview.focusMinutes}} 分钟</view><button size="mini" class="restore-confirm" bindtap="confirmRestore">恢复并覆盖本机数据</button></block></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!folders.length}}" class="card empty">还没有可归档的学习内容。</view>
  <block wx:for="{{folders}}" wx:key="key">
    <view class="card folder">
      <view class="folder-head" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="toggleFolder"><view><view class="month">📁 {{item.label}}</view><view class="muted">学习记录 {{item.recordCount}} 条 · 复盘 {{item.reviewCount}} 条 · 任务 {{item.taskCount}} 项</view></view><text>{{open[item.key]?'收起':'展开'}}</text></view>
      <block wx:if="{{open[item.key]}}">
        <view class="export-actions"><button size="mini" class="copy-summary" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="copySummary">复制本月摘要</button><button size="mini" class="copy-obsidian" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="copyObsidian">复制到 Obsidian</button></view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.tasks.length}}" class="subhead">任务</view>
        <block wx:for="{{item.tasks}}" wx:for-item="task" wx:key="id"><view class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{task.subject || '未分类'}} · {{task.statusLabel}}</view><view>{{task.done ? '✓ ' : ''}}{{task.title}}</view></view></block>
        <view wx:if="{{item.records.length}}" class="subhead">学习记录</view>
        <block wx:for="{{item.records}}" wx:for-item="record" wx:key="id"><view class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{record.displayDate}} · {{record.subject || '未分类'}}</view><view>{{record.content || '图片或文件附件记录'}}</view></view></block>
        <view wx:if="{{item.reviews.length}}" class="subhead">复盘条目</view>
        <block wx:for="{{item.reviews}}" wx:for-item="review" wx:key="id"><view class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{review.displayDate}} · {{review.type || '未分类'}}</view><view>{{review.content}}</view></view></block>
      </block>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
